      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest doesn't really change the fact that the spark is dead. i've been resting for months. it's not just burnout, it's like... the purpose is gone. the world doesn't need more noise, and i don't see any point in trying to find more color when everything just feels so heavy and gray. what's the point of just waiting for nothing to happen?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
